# payload-of: passing a non-variant value produces a deferred type error at access time.
# merge creates a lazy Overlay; the error surfaces when the Overlay is flattened.
[payload-of "not-a-variant"]
=== error
[E010] value serialization: expected Dict, got String (defined at stdlib/prelude.llt:935:10-935:11)
  --> stdlib/prelude.llt:935:10-935:11
   |
  935 |   [merge v []]]
      |          ^
